00:04:18,000 --> 00:04:24,000
They still have their secrets.

2
00:08:36,000 --> 00:08:42,000
The Secret Life of Pets 2 is a family, comedy,
adventure film directed by Chris Renaud.

3
00:12:54,000 --> 00:13:00,000
Max the terrier must cope with some major life changes
when his owner gets married and has a baby.

4
00:17:12,000 --> 00:17:18,000
When the family takes a trip to the countryside, nervous Max has numerous run-ins
with canine-intolerant cows, hostile foxes and a scary turkey.

5
00:21:30,000 --> 00:21:36,000
Luckily for Max, he soon catches a break when he meets Rooster, a gruff
farm dog who tries to cure the lovable pooch of his neuroses.

6
00:25:48,000 --> 00:25:54,000
Max (voice), played by Patton Oswalt.

7
00:30:06,000 --> 00:30:12,000
Snowball (voice), played by Kevin Hart.

8
00:34:24,000 --> 00:34:30,000
Duke (voice), played by Eric Stonestreet.

9
