Gidget (voice), played by Jenny Slate.

10
00:43:00,000 --> 00:43:06,000
Daisy (voice), played by Tiffany Haddish.

11
00:47:18,000 --> 00:47:24,000
Chloe (voice), played by Lake Bell.

12
00:51:36,000 --> 00:51:42,000
The Secret Life of Pets 2 is a 2019 American animated comedy film
directed by Chris Renaud and written by Brian Lynch.

13
00:55:54,000 --> 00:56:00,000
Produced by Illumination, it is the second feature film
in the Secret Life of Pets franchise.

14
01:00:12,000 --> 01:00:18,000
The film features the voices of Patton Oswalt, Eric Stonestreet, Jenny Slate, Kevin Hart, Tiffany Haddish, Lake Bell,
Nick Kroll, Dana Carvey, Ellie Kemper, Renaud, Hannibal Buress, Bobby Moynihan, and Harrison Ford.

15
01:04:30,000 --> 01:04:36,000
The Secret Life of Pets 2 was theatrically released in the United
States on June 7, 2019, by Universal Pictures.

16
01:08:48,000 --> 01:08:54,000
It received mixed reviews from critics, and grossed $431
million against a budget of $80 million.

17
01:13:06,000 --> 01:13:12,000
A further sequel is in development.

18
01:17:24,000 --> 01:17:30,000
The film explores themes of new york city, friendship, villain, sequel, dog.

19
01:21:42,000 --> 01:21:48,000
The tone is lighthearted.
